    "blocks_tibAtJ": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_0029bb1_KcYBnV": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_0029bb1",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How lab grown diamonds are created",
            "text": "<p>Lab grown diamonds are typically produced using one of two methods:</p><p><strong>High Pressure High Temperature (HPHT):</strong> Replicates the intense heat and pressure found deep within the earth to form a diamond crystal.</p><p><strong>Chemical Vapour Deposition (CVD):</strong> Grows a diamond layer by layer from carbon-rich gas in a controlled chamber.</p><p>Both methods result in genuine diamond material, not simulants or imitations.</p>",
            "heading_size_desktop": 30,
            "text_size_desktop": 18,
            "padding_left_desktop": 380,
            "padding_right_desktop": 380,
            "spacing_desktop": 40,
            "heading_size_mobile": 20,
            "text_size_mobile": 14,
            "padding_left_mobile": 40,
            "padding_right_mobile": 40,
            "spacing_mobile": 20,
            "text_alignment": "center",
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "text_color": "#000000"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "ai_gen_block_8322f0f_NxbT3a": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_8322f0f",
          "settings": {
            "padding_top_desktop": 0,
            "padding_bottom_desktop": 25,
            "padding_top_mobile": 5,
            "padding_bottom_mobile": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "ai_gen_block_0029bb1_ttipAX": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_0029bb1",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Lab grown diamond certification",
            "text": "<p>Lab grown diamonds are independently graded and certified in the same way as natural diamonds. Each stone is assessed using the 4Cs: cut, colour, clarity, and carat weight. The certification provides a detailed and transparent breakdown of the diamond’s quality, allowing for confident and informed decision-making.</p>",
            "heading_size_desktop": 30,
            "text_size_desktop": 18,
            "padding_left_desktop": 380,
            "padding_right_desktop": 380,
            "spacing_desktop": 40,
            "heading_size_mobile": 20,
            "text_size_mobile": 14,
            "padding_left_mobile": 40,
