        "ai_gen_block_0029bb1_GWhhwz": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_0029bb1",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Sourcing and standards",
            "text": "<p>At WILLIAM ÉDOUARD, lab grown diamonds are selected for their exceptional cut, balance, and overall visual performance. Each stone is sourced from established suppliers using advanced growth technology and is chosen based on strict internal quality standards.</p><p>Where available, diamonds may feature a microscopic laser inscription that aligns with their grading report, offering an additional layer of identification and assurance under magnification.</p>",
